---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="About | Hello World">
  <section class="prose dark:prose-invert max-w-prose py-6">
    <h1 class="text-4xl font-extrabold">About</h1>
    <p>
      Hello world! This is the about page of your new template site. Tell your readers who you
      are, what you do, and what they can expect to find on this site.
    </p>
    <p>
      This template is built with <a href="https://astro.build">Astro</a>, React islands for small
      interactive bits, MDX posts via Astro Content Collections, Tailwind CSS for styling, and
      deploys cleanly to Cloudflare Pages as a static site.
    </p>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>